# Lecture 12

### Custom SVG Images

---

## Custom Images

- Use your own SVG files as card images
- SVG provides crisp rendering at any size
- Name must match the markdown file

---

## When to Use SVG

- Diagrams and logos
- Icons not available in Iconify
- Images that need to scale cleanly

---

## Summary

Custom SVG images give you full control over card visuals when the Iconify collection does not have what you need.
